---
import Layout from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from "../consts";
---

<Layout title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
  <h1>I'm Jean-Philippe</h1>
  <p>
    Hybrid web developer & designer, specialized in UI and front-end
    development, experienced with the whole stack. My current tools of choice
    are React and React-Native on TypeScript, and more recently .NET/C#.
  </p>
  <p>
    I'm currently working for <a href="https://querydoctor.com" target="_blank">Query Doctor</a>,
    a small company creating tools and visualizations to help developers understand and optimize
    their PostgreSQL databases.
  <p>
    Outside of work, traveling, music & concerts, but also a lot of programming
    and side-projects. I have a recent interest for taking better care of my
    body: eating better, understanding what I eat, exercising more, and going
    to the gym. Previously, I did a lot of sports photography.
  </p>

  <h2>What's new?</h2>
  <p>
    I’m currently semi-nomad working and traveling the world, while building an
    application to find cool coffee shops near you. Also slowly attempting to
    learn Russian.
  </p>
</Layout>

<style>
  a {
    color: #bbc1b8;
  }

  a:hover {
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration-color: #bbc1b8;
  }

  a:not(:hover) {
    transition: 0.2s all ease-in-out;
  }
</style>
